1. Cheat Sheet
1. 🌱 Why Interpretability
A model that scores well can still be wrong for the wrong reasons. Explanations help you:
• Debug: find leakage, spurious features and data bugs
• Trust: stakeholders accept models they can question
• Comply: credit, health and hiring decisions often need reasons (adverse action notices, GDPR-style rights)
• Improve: errors point to missing features
• Detect bias: see whether a sensitive feature, or a proxy for it, drives predictions
TIP: If a feature you did not expect is the top driver, suspect leakage before you celebrate.
